        <mxCell id="p1-attack" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;사용자 요청 → CloudFront·WAF → DVWA Command Injection → EC2 IMDS Node Role Credential → 보호 S3 Object GetObject&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#5B6573;margin-top:7px;&quot;&gt;고정 검증 객체 validation/capital-one-demo.csv 사용 · 개인정보와 Credential 원문은 출력·로그·증적에 저장하지 않음&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0073BB;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=16;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="150" width="1060" height="112" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="p1-poll-source" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;정기 수집 대상&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Security S3&lt;/b&gt; · ALB Access Log&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudWatch Logs&lt;/b&gt; · CloudTrail · WAF · DVWA · CloudFront&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#5B6573;&quot;&gt;CloudTrail S3 사본은 장기 보관·Athena 재분석용이며 Wazuh 입력과 중복 수집하지 않음&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4FAEA;strokeColor=#6B9D1A;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=15;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="370" width="500" height="160" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-hot-source" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DVWA Audit Event Hot Copy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;event_type · result · route · take_id · pod_name · pod_uid&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;context.action · resource · security_level · stage · status&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#8A3B67;&quot;&gt;명령 원문·응답·Credential·Cookie 제거 · 승인 필드와 해시만 사용&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2F8;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=15;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="730" y="370" width="500" height="160" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-poll" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Wazuh AWS Module · 5분 Polling&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;S3와 CloudWatch Logs를 같은 주기로 조회&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;넓은 Source 범위 · 장기 조사·후속 확인 · Rule 100111 입력&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7FBEF;strokeColor=#6B9D1A;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=15;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="590" width="500" height="126" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-hot" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DVWA Audit Event 저지연 전달&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;CloudWatch Logs Subscription → Lambda → SQS → Local Bridge&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;Rule 100102 건전성 Event · Rule 100110 공격 Event 입력&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2F8;strokeColor=#E7157B;strokeWidth=2.5;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=15;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="730" y="590" width="500" height="126" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1-branch-note" value="&lt;b&gt;비선형 수집 구조&lt;/b&gt; · 같은 공격에서 여러 로그가 생성되고, 정기 Polling과 DVWA 저지연 전달은 독립적으로 Wazuh에 도착한다. 두 경로의 도착 순서와 지연은 같지 않다." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#475569;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="p1-1">
          <mxGeometry x="300" y="760" width="800" height="66" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
