        <mxCell id="p2-github110" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;GitHub Actions · soc-contain-dvwa.yml&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;main · CAPITAL-ONE · Rule 100110 · Pod name·UID · SHA-256 검증&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;deploy/dvwa/values.yaml의 격리 요청만 변경 · 동시 실행 제한·멱등 처리&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F4F6;strokeColor=#24292F;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#24292F;fontSize=14;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=7;" vertex="1" parent="p2-1">
